Description: record internet radio into separate audio tracks
 Command-line recorder for HTTP and HTTPS MP3, ADTS AAC and Ogg/Vorbis
 internet radio. Saves audio without transcoding, splits tracks using ICY
 metadata and supports Unicode filenames, ID3 tags and continuous recordings.
 .
 Supports PLS/M3U playlists, Zeno station pages and Radio Swiss Pop.
 HLS/DASH, DRM and Opus are not supported.
